{"@context":{"org":"http://www.w3.org/ns/org#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#","owl":"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#","dct":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/","dcat":"http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#","foaf":"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/","schema":"https://schema.org/","prov":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#","time":"http://www.w3.org/2006/time#","xsd":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#","rov":"http://www.w3.org/ns/regorg#","og":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/"},"@graph":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/european-union","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"European Union","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to the European Union (Brussels)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D2"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Cabinet Office holds overall responsibility for the UK's relationship with the EU; a Cabinet Office minister co-chaired the Trade and Cooperation Agreement Partnership Council and the Withdrawal Agreement Joint Committee in February 2026. Since July 2026 a joint Cabinet Office and Foreign Office Minister of State holds EU policy and relations. The Foreign Office runs the mission in Brussels.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state-minister-for-intergovernmental-relations-and-european-relations"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/joint-statement-on-the-withdrawal-agreement-joint-committee-and-trade-and-cooperation-agreement-partnership-council-meetings-2-february-2026"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-the-european-union"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/world-trade-organization","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"World Trade Organization","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to the WTO, UN and other international organisations (Geneva)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1480"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"Trade policy at the WTO was led by the Department for Business and Trade, now part of the Department for Business, Innovation, Science and Trade (from 9 November 2026). The Foreign Office runs the Geneva mission.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--163"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/api/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-the-wto-un-and-other-international-organisations-geneva"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/comprehensive-and-progressive-agreement-for-trans-pacific-partnership-cptpp","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"Comprehensive and Progressive Agreement for Trans-Pacific Partnership (CPTPP)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1480"}],"dct:description":"The Department for Business and Trade negotiated and holds UK membership; its work passed to the Department for Business, Innovation, Science and Trade on 9 November 2026.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/64b408cb48826b00103a9ed5/draft_explanatory_memorandum.pdf"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/api/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/asean","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"ASEAN","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to ASEAN (Jakarta)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's mission deepens the UK's engagement with ASEAN and its member states.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-asean"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/nato","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"NATO","og:ukWayIn":"UK Joint Delegation to NATO (Brussels)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D17"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The joint delegation, sponsored by the Ministry of Defence and the Foreign Office, is the link between the UK government and NATO.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-joint-delegation-to-nato"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/interpol","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"INTERPOL","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:PB558"}],"dct:description":"The National Crime Agency provides the UK's INTERPOL National Central Bureau (Manchester), the country's single point of contact for INTERPOL.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://nationalcrimeagency.gov.uk/what-we-do/how-we-work/providing-specialist-capabilities-for-law-enforcement/international-network"},{"@id":"https://www.interpol.int/en/Who-we-are/Member-countries/Europe/UNITED-KINGDOM"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/europol","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"Europol","og:ukWayIn":"UK Liaison Bureau at Europol (The Hague)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:PB558"}],"dct:description":"The National Crime Agency provides the UK Europol National Unit and leads the multi-agency UK Liaison Bureau.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://nationalcrimeagency.gov.uk/what-we-do/how-we-work/providing-specialist-capabilities-for-law-enforcement/international-network"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/osce","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"OSCE","og:ukWayIn":"UK Delegation to the OSCE (Vienna)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's delegation works with the OSCE and its participating states.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/organization-for-security-and-co-operation-in-europe"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/organisation-for-the-prohibition-of-chemical-weapons-opcw","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"Organisation for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons (OPCW)","og:ukWayIn":"UK Permanent Representative to the OPCW (The Hague)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office provides the UK Permanent Representative to the OPCW.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-position-on-briefing-by-russia-and-syria-at-the-opcw"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/united-nations-new-york","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"United Nations (New York)","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to the UN in New York","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's mission represents the UK across the UN's work in New York, including the Security Council.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-un-in-new-york"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/un-and-other-international-organisations-in-geneva","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"UN and other international organisations in Geneva","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to the WTO, UN and other international organisations (Geneva)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's Geneva mission engages every body where the UK is a member or observer there.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-the-wto-un-and-other-international-organisations-geneva"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/un-in-vienna-iaea-and-ctbto","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"UN in Vienna, IAEA and CTBTO","og:ukWayIn":"UK Mission to the UN in Vienna","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's Vienna mission represents the UK at the UN there, the International Atomic Energy Agency and the Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty Organization.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-mission-to-the-un-in-vienna"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/un-food-and-agriculture-agencies-in-rome-fao-wfp-ifad","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"UN food and agriculture agencies in Rome (FAO, WFP, IFAD)","og:ukWayIn":"UK Representation to the UN agencies in Rome (British Embassy Rome)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The British Embassy in Rome hosts the UK Representation to the United Nations agencies in Rome.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/british-embassy-rome"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/international-maritime-organization-imo","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"International Maritime Organization (IMO)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:EA78"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D9"}],"dct:description":"The Maritime and Coastguard Agency, the UK's maritime administration, leads the UK delegation with the Department for Transport.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/global-cooperation-brings-breakthrough-on-first-international-maritime-autonomous-surface-ships-mass-code"},{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/united-kingdom-national-maritime-strategy-for-the-imo-instruments-implementation-code/united-kingdom-national-maritime-strategy-for-the-imo-instruments-implementation-code"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/international-civil-aviation-organization-icao","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO)","og:ukWayIn":"UK Delegation on the ICAO Council (Montreal)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D9"}],"dct:description":"The Department for Transport answers for the Chicago Convention and ICAO, and fills and funds the UK's representative posts on the ICAO Council.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.caa.co.uk/media/pr2iffom/sspdiagram.pdf"},{"@id":"https://api.parliament.uk/historic-hansard/written-answers/1994/dec/12/international-civil-aviation-organisation"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/world-meteorological-organization-wmo","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"World Meteorological Organization (WMO)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:EA46"}],"dct:description":"The Met Office's Chief Executive is the UK's Permanent Representative to the WMO.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/corporate-news/2017/rob-varley-elected-as-wmo-first-vice-president"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/international-whaling-commission","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"International Whaling Commission","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D7"}],"dct:description":"The Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs sets out and represents the UK's position at the Commission.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/80th-anniversary-of-international-whaling-commission-uk-reiterates-strong-anti-whaling-stance-and-invests-150000-in-a-new-global-strandings-database"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/international-monetary-fund","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"International Monetary Fund","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D15"}],"dct:description":"The Chancellor of the Exchequer is the UK Governor of the IMF.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/chancellor-of-the-exchequer"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/world-bank-group","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"World Bank Group","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D15"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Chancellor and the Foreign Office's development minister speak for the UK as its Governors at the Development Committee.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/world-bank-group-and-international-monetary-fund-2026-spring-meetings-development-committee-uk-governors-statement"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/european-bank-for-reconstruction-and-development-ebrd","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D15"}],"dct:description":"The Chancellor of the Exchequer is the UK Governor of the EBRD.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/chancellor-of-the-exchequer"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/asian-infrastructure-investment-bank-aiib","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank (AIIB)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D15"}],"dct:description":"The Chancellor of the Exchequer is the UK Governor of the AIIB.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/chancellor-of-the-exchequer"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/g7-and-g20-finance-track","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"G7 and G20 (finance track)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D15"}],"dct:description":"The Chancellor leads on international economic and financial affairs at the G7 and G20.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/chancellor-of-the-exchequer"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/oecd","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"OECD","og:ukWayIn":"UK Permanent Delegation to the OECD (Paris)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's delegation represents the UK at the OECD.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-permanent-delegation-to-the-oecd"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/council-of-europe","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"Council of Europe","og:ukWayIn":"UK Delegation to the Council of Europe (Strasbourg)","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office's delegation represents the UK, a founding member.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-delegation-to-the-council-of-europe"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/the-commonwealth","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"The Commonwealth","og:ukWayIn":"UK Representation in the Commonwealth","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:D1315"}],"dct:description":"The Foreign Office holds the UK's representation in the Commonwealth.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/world/organisations/uk-representation-in-the-commonwealth"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/intl/european-space-agency-esa","@type":["org:Organization","schema:Organization"],"skos:prefLabel":"European Space Agency (ESA)","og:ukWayIn":"","og:ukLead":[{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/government-organisation:EA31"}],"dct:description":"The UK Space Agency holds the UK's ESA membership and commits most of its budget to ESA programmes.","dct:source":[{"@id":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/evaluating-the-benefits-of-the-uks-investments-in-the-european-space-agency/evaluating-the-benefits-of-the-uks-investments-in-the-european-space-agency-executive-summary"}]},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/membership/0","@type":"org:Membership","org:member":{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/wikidata:Q145"},"org:organization":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2863003"},"og:status":"current","skos:note":"ABCANZ Armies (current)"},{"@id":"https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/opengovernment-uk/id/membership/1","@type":"o